{
  "_comment": [
    "Declared on-host secret files for ringtail: every secret path the ringtail",
    "nix config references, with its vault source, ownership, and the unit to",
    "restart after a change. Declared state, metadata only \u2014 no values, the",
    "public repo stays clean.",
    "",
    "Owner task: `mise run seed-secrets ringtail` (human-run on gilbert,",
    "biometric 1Password); `--check` is the vault-free drift gate — the",
    "weekly host timer is the follow-on PR in eblume/blumeops#1524.",
    "",
    "Schema: secrets[] = { path, kind: op|generated, ref: op://\u2026 (op only),",
    "format (optional, how the vault value becomes file content), owner,",
    "group, mode (0[0-7]{3}), restart: [unit.service] (op only: a generated",
    "entry mints once, after a confirm, and restarts nothing) }.",
    "",
    "The flake invariant (invariants.nix) keeps this manifest in lockstep with",
    "the nix config: a referenced-but-undeclared or declared-but-unreferenced",
    "path fails the flake-check build. eblume/blumeops#1524;",
    "docs/reference/operations/declared-state-files.md"
  ],
  "secrets": [
    {
      "path": "/etc/k3s/token",
      "kind": "generated",
      "owner": "root",
      "group": "root",
      "mode": "0600"
    },
    {
      "path": "/etc/agents/op-token",
      "kind": "op",
      "ref": "op://vg6xf6vvfmoh5hqjjhlhbeoaie/agents-ringtail Service Account/credential",
      "owner": "agent",
      "group": "agent",
      "mode": "0400",
      "restart": ["agent-heph-spoke.service"]
    },
    {
      "path": "/etc/forgejo-runner/priv.env",
      "kind": "op",
      "ref": "op://vg6xf6vvfmoh5hqjjhlhbeoaie/w3663ffnvkewbftncqxtcpeavy/runner_ringtail_priv_token",
      "format": "TOKEN={value}",
      "owner": "root",
      "group": "root",
      "mode": "0600",
      "restart": ["gitea-runner-priv.service"]
    },
    {
      "path": "/etc/forgejo-runner/nix-builder-blumeops.env",
      "kind": "op",
      "ref": "op://vg6xf6vvfmoh5hqjjhlhbeoaie/w3663ffnvkewbftncqxtcpeavy/runner_ringtail_nix_builder_blumeops_token",
      "format": "TOKEN={value}",
      "owner": "root",
      "group": "root",
      "mode": "0600",
      "restart": ["gitea-runner-nix_container_builder_blumeops.service"]
    },
    {
      "path": "/etc/forgejo-runner/nix-builder-horkos.env",
      "kind": "op",
      "ref": "op://vg6xf6vvfmoh5hqjjhlhbeoaie/w3663ffnvkewbftncqxtcpeavy/runner_ringtail_nix_builder_horkos_token",
      "format": "TOKEN={value}",
      "owner": "root",
      "group": "root",
      "mode": "0600",
      "restart": ["gitea-runner-nix_container_builder_horkos.service"]
    },
    {
      "path": "/etc/forgejo-runner/nix-builder-talos.env",
      "kind": "op",
      "ref": "op://vg6xf6vvfmoh5hqjjhlhbeoaie/w3663ffnvkewbftncqxtcpeavy/runner_ringtail_nix_builder_talos_token",
      "format": "TOKEN={value}",
      "owner": "root",
      "group": "root",
      "mode": "0600",
      "restart": ["gitea-runner-nix_container_builder_talos.service"]
    },
    {
      "path": "/etc/forgejo-runner/nix-builder-hephaestus.env",
      "kind": "op",
      "ref": "op://vg6xf6vvfmoh5hqjjhlhbeoaie/w3663ffnvkewbftncqxtcpeavy/runner_ringtail_nix_builder_hephaestus_token",
      "format": "TOKEN={value}",
      "owner": "root",
      "group": "root",
      "mode": "0600",
      "restart": ["gitea-runner-nix_container_builder_hephaestus.service"]
    }
  ]
}
